      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوَّالَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A swarm,</i> or <i>large number, of locusts;</i>
(As, T, M, K;) a subst., like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَّانَةٌ</span> (M, K) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّالَةٌ</span>: (M:) or <i>an assemblage of locusts,</i> and <i>of
men.</i> (IAar, Th, T.)

